                                 <p class="oj-normal">(m)</p>
                              </td>
                              <td valign="top">
                                 <p class="oj-normal">‘Abu Ubaydah Yusuf Al-Anabi (alias (a) Abou ObeJda Youssef AI-Annabi, (b) Abu- Ubaydah Yusuf Al-lnabi, (c) Mebrak Yazid, (d) Youcef Abu Obeida, (e) Mibrak Yazid, (f) Yousif Abu Obayda Yazid, (g) Yazid Mebrak, (h) Yazid Mabrak, (i) Yusuf Abu Ubaydah, (j) Abou Youcef). Date of birth: 7.2.1969. Place of birth: Annaba, Algeria. Nationality: Algerian. Address: Algeria. Other information: Photo available for inclusion in the INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice. Date of designation referred to in Article 7d(2)(i): 29.2.2016.’</p>
                                 <p class="oj-normal">is replaced by the following:</p>
                                 <p class="oj-normal">‘Abu Ubaydah Yusuf Al-Anabi (good quality alias: (a) Abou Obeida Youssef Al-Annabi, (b) Abu-Ubaydah Yusuf Al-lnabi; low quality alias: (a) Mebrak Yazid, (b) Youcef Abu Obeida, (c) Mibrak Yazid, (d) Yousif Abu Obayda Yazid, (e) Yazid Mebrak, (f) Yazid Mabrak, (g) Yusuf Abu Ubaydah, (h) Abou Youcef). Date of birth: 7.2.1969. Place of birth: Annaba, Algeria. Nationality: Algerian. Address: Algeria. Other information: (a) A leader of the Organization of Al-Qaida in the Islamic Maghreb (AQIM); (b) Father’s name is Omar Mebrak; (c) Mother’s name is Zohra Mebrak. Date of designation referred to in Article 7d(2), point (i): 29.2.2016.’;</p>
                              </td>
