                        <col width="4%"/>
                        <col width="96%"/>
                        <tbody>
                           <tr>
                              <td valign="top">
                                 <p class="oj-normal">(a)</p>
                              </td>
                              <td valign="top">
                                 <p class="oj-normal">‘Wafa Humanitarian Organisation (alias: (a) Al Wafa; (b) Al Wafa Organization; (c) Wafa Al-Igatha Al-Islamia). Address: (a) Jordan House No. 125, Street 54, Phase II Hayatabad, Peshawar, Pakistan (at the time of listing); (b) Kuwait (at the time of listing); (c) United Arab Emirates (at the time of listing); (d) Afghanistan (at the time of listing). Other information: Headquarters was in Kandahar, Afghanistan as at 2001. Date of designation referred to in Article 7e(e): 6.10.2001.’</p>
                                 <p class="oj-normal">is replaced by the following:</p>
                                 <p class="oj-normal">‘Wafa Humanitarian Organisation (alias: (a) Al Wafa; (b) Al Wafa Organization; (c) Wafa Al-Igatha Al-Islamia). Address: (a) Kuwait (at the time of listing); (b) United Arab Emirates (at the time of listing); (c) Afghanistan (at the time of listing). Other information: (a) Headquarters was in Kandahar, Afghanistan as at 2001; (b) Wafa was a component of Al-Qaida in 2001. Date of designation referred to in Article 7e, point (e): 6.10.2001.’;</p>
                              </td>
