                        <tbody>
                           <tr>
                              <td valign="top">
                                 <p class="oj-normal">(b)</p>
                              </td>
                              <td valign="top">
                                 <p class="oj-normal">‘Ummah Tameer E-Nau (UTN) (alias UTN). Address: Street 13, Wazir Akbar Khan, Kabul Afghanistan, Pakistan. Other information: (a) Its directors included Mahmood Sultan Bashir-Ud-Din, Majeed Abdul Chaudhry and Mohammed Tufail; (b) Banned in Pakistan. Date of designation referred to in Article 2a (4) (b): 24.12. 2001.’</p>
                                 <p class="oj-normal">is replaced by the following:</p>
                                 <p class="oj-normal">‘Ummah Tameer E-Nau (UTN) (alias UTN). Address: Street 13, Wazir Akbar Khan, Kabul Afghanistan. Other information: (a) Its directors included Mahmood Sultan Bashir-Ud-Din, Majeed Abdul Chaudhry and Mohammed Tufail; (b) Banned in Pakistan. Date of designation referred to in Article 7e, point (e): 24.12.2001.’;</p>
                              </td>
