                        <col width="4%"/>
                        <col width="96%"/>
                        <tbody>
                           <tr>
                              <td valign="top">
                                 <p class="oj-normal">(d)</p>
                              </td>
                              <td valign="top">
                                 <p class="oj-normal">‘Lashkar i Jhangvi (LJ) (alias LJ). Other information: (a) Based primarily in Pakistan’s Punjab region and in the city of Karachi; (b) Active in Pakistan although banned as at 2010. Date of designation referred to in Article 2a (4) (b): 3.2.2003.’</p>
                                 <p class="oj-normal">is replaced by the following:</p>
                                 <p class="oj-normal">‘Lashkar i Jhangvi (LJ) (alias LJ). Other information: Banned in Pakistan as at 2010. Date of designation referred to in Article 7e, point (e): 3.2.2003.’;</p>
                              </td>
                           </tr>
                        </tbody>
                     </table>
                     <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                        <col width="4%"/>
                        <col width="96%"/>
                        <tbody>
                           <tr>
                              <td valign="top">
                                 <p class="oj-normal">(e)</p>
                              </td>
                              <td valign="top">
                                 <p class="oj-normal">‘Al-Haramain Foundation (Pakistan). Address: House No 279, Nazimuddin Road, F-10/1, Islamabad, Pakistan (at the time of listing). Date of designation referred to in Article 2a (4) (b): 26.1.2004.’</p>
                                 <p class="oj-normal">is replaced by the following:</p>
                                 <p class="oj-normal">‘Al-Haramain Foundation (Pakistan). Address: House No 279, Nazimuddin Road, F-10/1, Islamabad, Pakistan (at the time of listing). Other information: As at late 2025, it was not active and had no structures in Pakistan. Date of designation referred to in Article 7e, point (e): 26.1.2004.’;</p>
