                              </td>
                              <td valign="top">
                                 <p class="oj-normal">‘Mouvement pour l’Unification et le Jihad en Afrique de l’Ouest (MUJAO). Address: (a) Mali, (b) Algeria. Date of designation referred to in Article 2a (4) (b): 5.12.2012.’</p>
                                 <p class="oj-normal">is replaced by the following:</p>
                                 <p class="oj-normal">‘Mouvement pour l’Unification et le Jihad en Afrique de l’Ouest (MUJAO) (original script: حركة التوحيد والجهاد في غرب إفريقيا). Address: (a) Mali, (b) Algeria. Other information: (a) Associated with The Organization of Al-Qaida in the Islamic Maghreb, Al Mourabitoun and Mokhtar Belmokhtar; (b) Active in the Sahel/Sahara region. Date of designation referred to in Article 7e, point (e): 5.12.2012.’</p>
